101 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (By combining attack simulation with defensive monitoring, the project demonstrates how easily wireless networks can be compromised using readily available tools. It serves as an educational platform to bridge the gap between theoretical security and hands-on application, helping students and network administrators recognize vulnerabilities and potential breaches before they lead to significant damage. Ultimately, WIDMS aims to raise awareness and promote proactive monitoring in home and small office environments)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
